---
import SectionIntro from '../ui/SectionIntro.astro';
---

<section id="skills" class="section-padding">
    <h1 class="mb-12 text-6xl font-extrabold">WHAT I DO.</h1>
    <SectionIntro>
        Part of being a student-developer gives me the opportunity to keep
        exploring different technologies, and experiment with new ideas. With
        lots of love, every project is a new challenge and opportunity to learn
        and grow. From initialization to deployment, I bring curiosity, wonder,
        and excitement along the way.
    </SectionIntro>
    <div class="flex mt-16 w-full">
        <div class="flex-1">
            <h2>TL;DR</h2>
            <p>I do a lot. Just email me:</p>
            <button>mamplata.cb@gmail.com</button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 justify-end space-x-24">
            <div>
                <h2 class="eyebrow">[ WEB ]</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Internal Systems</li>
                    <li>Portfolio</li>
                    <li>Database Design</li>
                    <li>Front-end Development</li>
                    <li>Back-end Development</li>
                    <li>API Development</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h2 class="eyebrow">[ GAME ]</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>2D Game Development</li>
                    <li>Gameplay Mechanics</li>
                    <li>Prototyping</li>
                    <li>Game Assets</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h2 class="eyebrow">[ DESIGN ]</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>UI/UX Design</li>
                    <li>Interaction Design</li>
                    <li>2D Illustrations</li>
                    <li>3D Modeling</li>
                    <li>2D/3D Animations</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
